dress.\",\"withdraw_reason_invalid_amount\":\"Enter a valid amount greater than 0.\",\"withdraw_reason_invalid_evm_address\":\"That isn't a valid EVM (0x) wallet address.\",\"withdraw_reason_own_address\":\"That's your own wallet address. Enter a different recipient.\",\"withdraw_reason_solana_address\":\"That's a Solana address. {{symbol}} in this wallet is on {{chain}} — paste a 0x wallet address instead.\",\"withdraw_reason_too_many_decimals\":\"{{symbol}} supports at most {{decimals}} decimal places.\",\"withdraw_reason_transfer_rejected_by_token\":\"This coin's contract rejected the transfer, so it can't be sent from this wallet.\",\"withdraw_subtitle\":\"Withdraw coins to any Solana wallet address.\",\"withdraw_subtitle_multichain\":\"Withdraw coins to any Solana wallet, or send EVM coins to a 0x wallet on their chain.\",\"withdraw_symbol\":\"Withdraw {{symbol}}\",\"your_balance\":\"Your balance\"},\"wallet_deprecation\":{\"banner_body\":\"Add an email or social login now to keep this account and everything on it.\",\"banner_days_one\":\"Wallet sign-in ends in {{count}} day.\",\"banner_days_other\":\"Wallet sign-in ends in {{count}} days.\",\"banner_dismiss\":\"Dismiss\",\"banner_hours_one\":\"Wallet sign-in ends in {{count}} hour.\",\"banner_hours_other\":\"Wallet sign-in ends in {{count}} hours.\",\"banner_imminent\":\"Wallet sign-in is ending now.\",\"banner_learn_more\":\"Learn more\",\"banner_past\":\"Wallet sign-in is ending soon.\",\"cutover_notice_body\":\"Signed in with a browser wallet before? Use the email or social login you linked to it. Never linked one? Open the Pump app, import your wallet and choose Link email \u0026 socials, or start fresh below.\",\"cutover_notice_title\":\"Wallet sign-in has ended\",\"footer_link\":\"Wallet sign-in changes\",\"link_already_linked_title\":\"Already linked\",\"link_code_label\":\"6-digit code\",\"link_email_label\":\"Email address\",\"link_evm_key_body\":\"This account's EVM wallet ({{evmAddress}}) was created in the pump.fun app, so it needs its own key. In the app: Manage account → View wallets → your EVM wallet → Export private key. Paste that key, or the seed phrase it came from. Nothing is imported until it matches.\",\"link_evm_key_invalid\":\"That doesn't look like an EVM private key or a seed phrase.\",\"link_evm_key_mismatch\":\"That key belongs to a different EVM wallet, not to this account's ({{evmAddress}}).\",\"link_evm_key_placeholder\":\"EVM private key or seed phrase\",\"link_evm_key_title\":\"Import your EVM wallet key\",\"link_finalize_failed_body\":\"Your wallet key is now saved with {{identifier}}, but the last step didn't go through. Try again now, or it will finish on its own the next time you open this.\",\"link_finalize_failed_title\":\"Almost linked\",\"link_hardware_hint\":\"Using a Ledger or a multisig? Those keys can't be imported. Sign out, create a new login and move your funds to it.\",\"link_import_cta\":\"Import and finish\",\"link_intro\":\"Choose an email or social login for {{address}}. Your positions, callouts, followers and username stay exactly where they are.\",\"link_key_body\":\"Paste the private key for {{address}}. In Phantom: Settings → Manage accounts → this account → Show private key. The key is encrypted in your browser and stored end-to-end encrypted by our login provider. Your wallet keeps working for everything else.\",\"link_key_evm_again_body\":\"Your Solana key is already saved with this login. Paste it once more so your EVM wallet ({{evmAddress}}) is imported too.\",\"link_key_invalid\":\"That doesn't look like a Solana private key.\",\"link_key_mismatch\":\"That key belongs to a different wallet, not to this account ({{address}}). Paste the key for the account you're signed in with.\",\"link_key_placeholder\":\"Private key\",\"link_key_safety\":\"pump.fun only ever asks for a key here, inside your signed-in account. Nobody from pump.fun will ask for it by DM, email or on X.\",\"link_key_title\":\"Import your wallet key\",\"link_send_code\":\"Send code\",\"link_success_body\":\"From now on, sign in with {{identifier}} on pump.fun and in the Pump app. Wallet sign-in for this account is turned off.\",\"link_verify_code\":\"Verify\",\"link_wallet_exists\":\"This login already has its own Pump wallet. Sign in with it to see that wallet, or use a different email to keep this one.\",\"link_wallet_exists_toast\":\"That login already has a Pump account with its own wallets. Use a new email or social to link this wallet.\",\"notice_body\":\"From {{date}} you'll sign in to pump.fun with email, Google, Apple or GitHub. If you already sign in with a wallet like Phantom, sign in with it once more and add a login from your profile.\",\"notice_in_app_browser\":\"Using Phantom's in-app browser? Use email to sign in — Google sign-in is blocked inside wallet browsers.\",\"notice_title\":\"Browser-wallet sign-in is being retired\",\"privy_owned\":\"This wallet is now a pump.fun login account. Sign in with {{provider}} instead.\",\"privy_owned_generic\":\"This wallet is now a pump.fun login account. Sign in with the email or social login you linked to it.\",\"signup_blocked\":\"Wallet sign-ups are closed. Sign up with Google, Apple, GitHub or email instead.\",\"switch_to_privy\":\"Sign in with email or social\",\"wall_app_steps\":\"In the Pump app: Import wallet → Settings → Link email \u0026 socials, then sign in here with that login.\",\"wall_body\":\"Browser-wallet sign-in was retired on {{date}}. Your funds are still in your wallet and this account is untouched. Add an email or social login to keep it, or sign out and start a new account.\",\"wall_cta_app\":\"Do it in the Pump app\",\"wall_cta_signout\":\"Sign out and use a different login\",\"wall_current_login\":\"Signed in with\",\"wall_footnote\":\"Your funds and your address don't change. Only how you sign in does.\",\"wall_title\":\"Add a login to keep using pump.fun\"}}}}\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"80:null\n"])</script